    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10df0483aef10246b12ce8a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无数赛马娘曾在此战胜强敌，\n作为世代最强传颂于后世！\n――如此、名誉的一战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "799a66808828ddf0a67abca4fe566ba9cd501049ec2d6e5e66838d91c6b117c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
