    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d041543f0c8dafb1a113ae57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7836f263ee22fc7e03bc271e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "用胜利，将观众席融为一体。\n那副景象，一定就是我的原点。\n所以今天便是我的――集大成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a34ece3a7d7bec2b4b1b193a4af4032d3157809625bf8291c043ac52b3f7acc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e02cbfd6427334059a0cb5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到比萨胜驹平静的宣言，\n荣进闪耀露出了微笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9559e06dc8bf9fdbdd4480044f733419eb753e34460015205839f515b796dc86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c987c01455470a13a56fed1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀",
      "source_fingerprint": "dddbabf0a14340be785a6989ad9c1b0d7af7714ae783df71e025920875aeeda6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dda998e767a7e4e423df33b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f79344ea19705a9b920593ec480322b52a76ce0116d1ddcefe180d9203c98bb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
