    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f09fe992f2ea66ed22f79959",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此刻，我要将深埋之名――\n“荣进闪耀”之名，镌刻于此。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cabec8b63dcfd47302b39649217e9dac6aed0c88264130c10c313bf0a9a4e37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4eea331ecd22924ae21df9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不久，时刻来临。\n肩负时代重任的精英们、角逐顶点的瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "862c3810ea3e1135dfd2790af9c5b7cfb0b2b646fc15f9e9c525e2e6e3ecc06e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b248aba00fb81ea1049dcbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fd2a18d753adf5e8c4d6b61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………。\n每当听到外面的喧嚣，我便会想起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0775106cee807a949adb7f15a1245f531ebd86bcec9bad80e5bb7e221da7a16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
