    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:099654f4272980a196bd9953",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――人们心灵相系的瞬间，\n我初次目睹的那一天的情景。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bfc7356a15ab30c4f074925b8755bf5e34c67adb519a6f1f210a0569d21b6d5",
